      "10": "oi men gar pros oligas hmeras kata to dokoun dokoun autois epaideuon epaideuon o de epi to sumferon sumferon eis to metalabein metalabein ths agiothtos autou",
      "11": "pasa men paideia pros men to paron paron ou dokei dokei caras einai einai alla luphs usteron de karpon eirhnikon tois di auths gegumnasmenois gegumnasmenois apodidwsin apodidwsin dikaiosunhs",
