      "12": "dio kai ihsous ina agiash agiash dia tou idiou aimatos ton laon exw ths pulhs epaqen epaqen",
      "13": "toinun exercwmeqa exercwmeqa pros auton exw ths parembolhs ton oneidismon autou ferontes ferontes",
      "14": "ou gar ecomen ecomen wde menousan menousan polin alla thn mellousan mellousan epizhtoumen epizhtoumen",
