      "18": "proseucesqe proseucesqe peri hmwn peiqomeqa peiqomeqa gar oti kalhn suneidhsin ecomen ecomen en pasin kalws qelontes qelontes anastrefesqai anastrefesqai",
      "19": "perissoterws de parakalw parakalw touto poihsai poihsai ina taceion apokatastaqw apokatastaqw umin",
      "20": "o de qeos ths eirhnhs o anagagwn anagagwn ek nekrwn ton poimena twn probatwn ton megan en aimati diaqhkhs aiwniou ton kurion hmwn ihsoun",
      "21": "katartisai katartisai umas en panti agaqw eis to poihsai poihsai to qelhma autou poiwn poiwn en hmin to euareston enwpion autou dia ihsou cristou w h doxa eis tous aiwnas twn aiwnwn amhn",
      "22": "parakalw parakalw de umas adelfoi anecesqe anecesqe tou logou ths paraklhsews kai gar dia bracewn epesteila epesteila umin",
      "23": "ginwskete ginwskete ton adelfon hmwn timoqeon apolelumenon apolelumenon meq ou ean taceion erchtai erchtai oyomai oyomai umas",
      "24": "aspasasqe aspasasqe pantas tous hgoumenous hgoumenous umwn kai pantas tous agious aspazontai aspazontai umas oi apo ths italias",
