      "10": "hxei hxei de hmera kuriou ws klepths en h oi ouranoi roizhdon pareleusontai pareleusontai stoiceia de kausoumena kausoumena luqhsetai luqhsetai kai gh kai ta en auth erga eureqhsetai eureqhsetai",
      "11": "toutwn outws pantwn luomenwn luomenwn potapous dei dei uparcein uparcein umas en agiais anastrofais kai eusebeiais",
      "12": "prosdokwntas prosdokwntas kai speudontas speudontas thn parousian ths tou qeou hmeras di hn ouranoi puroumenoi puroumenoi luqhsontai luqhsontai kai stoiceia kausoumena kausoumena thketai thketai",
