      "1": "o presbuteros eklekth kuria kai tois teknois auths ous egw agapw agapw en alhqeia kai ouk egw monos alla kai pantes oi egnwkotes egnwkotes thn alhqeian",
      "2": "dia thn alhqeian thn menousan menousan en hmin kai meq hmwn estai estai eis ton aiwna",
