      "9": "pas o proagwn proagwn kai mh menwn menwn en th didach tou cristou qeon ouk ecei ecei o menwn menwn en th didach outos kai ton patera kai ton uion ecei ecei",
      "10": "ei tis ercetai ercetai pros umas kai tauthn thn didachn ou ferei ferei mh lambanete lambanete auton eis oikian kai cairein cairein autw mh legete legete",
      "11": "o legwn legwn gar autw cairein cairein koinwnei koinwnei tois ergois autou tois ponhrois",
