      "11": "agaphte mh mimou mimou to kakon alla to agaqon o agaqopoiwn agaqopoiwn ek tou qeou estin o kakopoiwn kakopoiwn ouc ewraken ewraken ton qeon",
      "12": "dhmhtriw memarturhtai memarturhtai upo pantwn kai upo auths ths alhqeias kai hmeis de marturoumen marturoumen kai oidas oidas oti h marturia hmwn alhqhs estin estin",
