      "4": "iwanhs tais epta ekklhsiais tais en th asia caris umin kai eirhnh apo o wn wn kai o hn hn kai o ercomenos ercomenos kai apo twn epta pneumatwn a enwpion tou qronou autou",
      "5": "kai apo ihsou cristou o martus o pistos o prwtotokos twn nekrwn kai o arcwn twn basilewn ths ghs tw agapwnti agapwnti hmas kai lusanti lusanti hmas ek twn amartiwn hmwn en tw aimati autou",
      "6": "kai epoihsen epoihsen hmas basileian iereis tw qew kai patri autou autw h doxa kai to kratos eis tous aiwnas twn aiwnwn amhn",
