      "8": "egw eimi eimi to alfa kai to w legei legei kurios o qeos o wn wn kai o hn hn kai o ercomenos ercomenos o pantokratwr",
      "9": "egw iwanhs o adelfos umwn kai sunkoinwnos en th qliyei kai basileia kai upomonh en ihsou egenomhn egenomhn en th nhsw th kaloumenh kaloumenh patmw dia ton logon tou qeou kai thn marturian ihsou",
      "10": "egenomhn egenomhn en pneumati en th kuriakh hmera kai hkousa hkousa opisw mou fwnhn megalhn ws salpiggos",
      "11": "legoushs legoushs o blepeis blepeis grayon grayon eis biblion kai pemyon pemyon tais epta ekklhsiais eis efeson kai eis smurnan kai eis pergamon kai eis quateira kai eis sardeis kai eis filadelfian kai eis laodikian",
      "12": "kai epestreya epestreya blepein blepein thn fwnhn htis elalei elalei met emou kai epistreyas epistreyas eidon eidon epta lucnias crusas",
      "13": "kai en mesw twn lucniwn omoion uion anqrwpou endedumenon endedumenon podhrh kai periezwsmenon periezwsmenon pros tois mastois zwnhn crusan",
      "14": "h de kefalh autou kai ai trices leukai ws erion leukon ws ciwn kai oi ofqalmoi autou ws flox puros",
